Hi [~accountid:60cdaa45a17463007061ed8e] , we have discussed this matter and concluded that: 

* the documents requested should remain the same, since it would appear prudent in light on money laundering legislation in PT and also in view of the new EU regulation  (DSA) that is to come;
* there should be a global project on onboarding of partners in view of the new EU regulation and therefore it is not recommended to change WOW at this moment that are to be adapted at global level really soon and going in the direction of the KYC steps you have already implemented;
* I added clarity notes on the document you shared, which were also aligned with Marilin and tax team: [https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pl6WsIox7aCsFbw_8MqCTgz52hu-cTtoiPQsbhCSzMg/edit|https://docs.google.com/document/d/1pl6WsIox7aCsFbw_8MqCTgz52hu-cTtoiPQsbhCSzMg/edit|smart-link] ;
