* {color:#ff5630}_If your employment terminates (for any reason) prior to the agreed end date of the Workplace Nursery Agreement, you will be liable to repay to the company the cost of any future payments due by the company to the Workplace Nursery in relation to the provision of this benefit, from the date of termination of your employment up until the agreed end date of the Workplace Nursery Agreement._  {color}
* {color:#ff5630}_On this basis, you agree to us deducting sums from your final salary or any outstanding payments due to you._  {color}
* {color:#ff5630}_If the value of the costs owed exceed your final salary payment or any outstanding payments due to you, you agree to make payment to the company of any outstanding costs owed within 14 days of the date of the termination of your employment._{color}
* {color:#ff5630}_You agree that if we waive your obligation to repay any costs falling due to the company, you will be solely responsible for any tax that may become payable as a result of said waiver and you shall indemnify the company on a continuing basis in relation to any such tax._{color}

